      "verified_by": "a_conditional_tail_guard_requires_lookahead_byte",
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "Missing end-of-buffer guard. `njs_lexer_multi()` enters its lookahead loop based only on remaining token-table candidates and never proves `lexer->start < lexer->end` before reading another byte from the script buffer."
